        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Bun bo Hue is a spicy lemongrass-scented noodle soup from central Vietnam. The key step is making an annatto oil . frying "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "annatto"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "annatto seeds "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "in oil to extract their colour before adding to the broth. This recipe serves 4 and benefits from a long, gentle simmer."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The lemongrass must be "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "lemongrass-bruise"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "bruised "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "before going into the pot to release its oils. Use the thick end of the stalk only and hit it firmly with a knife handle."
          }
        ]
      },
